title: drac2
---
<<set $charname to "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
You: *knock knock*
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: You may come in.
<<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: *yells* The door's open!
<<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: Come in but please don't turn off the lämp.
<<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: Oh you... just get in already!
<<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    {$charname}: If the smell of sweat doesn't bother you, then come in.
<<endif>>
You:
-> thx
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: Thanks for letting me in.
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: You're welcome.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: No problem.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: Of kós.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        {$charname}: You're always welcome. *winks*
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        {$charname}: ...9...10...11...12!
        {$charname}: No worries, darling, I just had to finish my reps.
    <<endif>>
-> huh
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum - 1>>
    <<endif>>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        You: Shouldn't it be the other way around?
        {$charname}: Probably.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        You: Why are you yelling?
        {$charname}: Because my room is really dark.
        {$charname}: Which means I can't hear you so well.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        You: The lämp?
        {$charname}: Yes, the lämp.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        You: Um, I am in.
        {$charname}: *amused smile* I can see that.
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        You: Why are you sweaty?
        {$charname}: These muscles have to be worked out or they get restless.
        You stare at her muscles.
        Somehow you get it.
    <<endif>>
-> boo
    You: Boo!
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: *blinks very slowly*
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: Ah, you almost got me.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: *nods in agreement*
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        {$charname}: Now aren't you just adorable.
        You blush.
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        {$charname}: ...9...10...11...12!
        {$charname}: Sorry, did you say something?
    <<endif>>
You: I am here to get to know you better!
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: Don't you say that to everyone?
    You: ...
    You: Yes, but I guess that's the point of the show?
    {$charname}: Touché.
<<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: Sure thing but please close the door.
    {$charname}: I am still hungover.
    Hungover? But how? Was there a party after the elimination ceremony you weren't invited to?
    The thought is gnawing on you like a very weak zombie.
<<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: Yes, a great idea. 
    {$charname}: We can start by looking at the lämp together.
    You stare at the lamp.
    It is kinda pretty.
<<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: Oooh, I can't wait for it.
    {$charname}: You can come an sit next to me if you want to.
    You want to.
    You don't know why but you really want to.
<<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    {$charname}: You are lucky, I just finished all my reps.
    {$charname}: ...
    {$charname}: Maybe I should go and have a shower first.
    You: Oh no, it's fine.
    It really is.
    Somehow she smells really nice.
<<endif>>
You: So...
-> ask about favourite dinosaur
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: My favourite dinosaur is the Pterodactylus. Which one is yours?
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: The Indominus Rex.
        You: That is not a real dinosaur.
        {$charname}: Is any dinosaur actually "real"?
        You: Yes?
        {$charname}: That's what they want you to believe.
        You: Who?
        {$charname}: The dinosaurs.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: Ooof.
        {$charname}: Probably the one with the long neck?
        You: The Brontosaurus?
        You: The Brachiosaurus?
        You: The Diplodocus?
        You: The Apatosaurus?
        You: The Argentinosaurus?
        {$charname}: Ah, my bad.
        {$charname}: I meant the Compsognathus.
        You: That's a fucking chicken.
        {$charname}: A dinosaur chicken.
        You: Aren't all chicken dinosaurs?
        {$charname}: Maybe but not all dinosaurs are chicken.
        You: Can't argue with that.
        {$charname}: *cheep*
        You: *cheep*
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: I guess that would be Archaeolepis mane.
        You: But that's a moth?
        {$charname}: Correct.
        You: And not a dinosaur?
        {$charname}: Correct.
        You: ...
        You: I like your confidence.
        {$charname}: I like lämp.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        {$charname}: Definitely the Ichthyosaurus.
        {$charname}: Anything with big fins is bound to be a favourite of mine.
        He winks at you.
        You blush.
        You have no idea what he means but still you blush.
        There must be something wrong with you.
        {$charname}: Everything all right?
        He looks half concerned, half amused.
        You must have stared.
        You just hope you didn't drool.
        Again.
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        {$charname}: Let me think.
        {$charname}: Not the T-Rex.
        {$charname}: Not with these embarrassingly weak arms.
        You nod.
        A valid concern.
        {$charname}: I think the Deinonychus would be a good choice.
        {$charname}: Strong hunter.
        {$charname}: Fearsome predator.
        {$charname}: Very likely feathered.
        {$charname}: What's not to love?
    <<endif>>
-> talk about the last time you slipped on a banana peel
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum - 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: It really hurt.
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        You: I broke my elbow.
        {$charname}: I don't care that you broke your elbow.
        You: Really?
        {$charname}: No of course not, do you have any x-rays?
        You show her the x-rays.
        She snatches them out of your hands and spends about 10 minutes looking at them while occasionally muttering "...bones...".
        It is kind of endearing.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: Aww, that sounds awful.
        You: It was.
        You: And the worst thing is that it keeps happening to me.
        You: At least once a week.
        {$charname}: Sounds like you really pissed off some monkeys.
        {$charname}: I once, accidentally of course, stole a clown's car.
        {$charname}: I kept wondering how it was so much bigger on the inside.
        {$charname}: And why suddenly I had some kind of encounter with a cake almost everyday.
        {$charname}: I stepped in them, they were thrown at me, you name it.
        {$charname}: It stopped when the police arrested me and the clown got the car back.
        You: You went to jail??
        {$charname}: Of course not.
        {$charname}: I am a witch.
        {$charname}: I was burned at the stake.
        You: ???
        {$charname}: *winks* I bet you were wondering why I am so hot.
        {$charname}: Also I have a spell for that kind of situation.
        {$charname}: Obviously.
        {$charname}: Or I wouldn't be here.
        You nod.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: Where you looking at the sun?
        You: Huh?
        {$charname}: When it happend?
        You: Uuuh... maybe?
        {$charname}: *nods solemnly* The sun can be very distracting.
        You: It... is a big lämp I guess?
        {$charname}: You are right.
        They look at you an beam.
        Almost brighter than the sun.
        And definitely brighter that the lämp.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        {$charname}: Oh no.
        {$charname}: Does it still hurt?
        You rub your elbow.
        You: Sometimes.
        {$charname}: Shall I kiss it better?
        You: Uuuuh... yeah?
        He takes your elbow and kisses it very lightly.
        His lips are suprisingly warm and unsurprisingly wet.
        Your elbow actually seems to hurt less.
        {$charname}: *winks* Fishmagic.
        You: But how?
        {$charname}: It runs in the family.
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        {$charname}: Did you break anything?
        You: I broke my elbow?
        {$charname}: Poor dear.
        {$charname}: First time?
        You: ...yeah.
        {$charname}: Which means your bones are strong. In general at least.
        {$charname}: But you should get even stronger.
        {$charname}: I used to be weak like you.
        You: Hey!
        {$charname}: But then I started to get stronger.
        {$charname}: And stronger.
        {$charname}: And stronger.
        {$charname}: And stronger.
        {$charname}: And stronger.
        {$charname}: And now I am really strong.
        You: So you don't break any bones?
        {$charname}: No, now I break things with my bones.
        You marvel at her muscles.
        Because you can't see her bones.
    <<endif>>
-> insinuate that the moon is not real
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: The moon is fake.
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: You mean the moonlanding?
        You: No... the moon.
        {$charname}: A fascinating hypothesis.
        You: The moonlanding is obviously real.
        {$charname}: You know, there is an obvious question I could ask you know.
        {$charname}: But I hate being obvious.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: Then what is the big round thing in the sky at night?
        You refuse to elaborate.
        {$charname}: Are you for real?
        He shoots you an incredulous look.
        You've seen that look before.
        It doesn't faze you at all.
        {$charname}: You know, I've been to the moon.
        {$charname}: Several times.
        {$charname}: My great-great-great aunt Mildred lives there.
        {$charname}: With her bunnies.
        {$charname}: They bake the greatest rice cake you ever tasted.
        {$charname}: And you are telling me that the moon isn't real?
        {$charname}: That my great-great-great aunt Mildred and her bunnies aren't real?
        {$charname}: That the ricecake isn't real??
        {$charname}: I find that hard to believe.
        You silently point to the poster on the wall that says "I believe."
        {$charname}: Well played.
        You: Don't hate the player, hate the game.
        {$charname}: I hate you.
        But he laughs.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: Of kós.
        {$charname}: It's the Great Lämp.
        You: Wouldn't that be the sun?
        {$charname}: No, the sun is the sun.
        You: Obviously.
        {$charname}: Fellow believer.
        They take your hands.
        The lämp shines on you both.
        Just sitting in comfortable silence.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        {$charname}: If you say so.
        You: I do.
        {$charname}: Then who am I to argue.
        {$charname}: Especially with someone with such pretty eyes.
        It's the oldest line in the book.
        But somehow he makes it work.
        You're blushing.
        Hard.
        Uh oh.
        You are in danger.
        You scan the small part of your brain that's still working for something to say.
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        {$charname}: You know I never cared much for it anyways.
        You: You didn't?
        {$charname}: I always thought that the moon was kinda overrated.
        {$charname}: Everyone kept telling me how romantic it was.
        {$charname}: Doing things in the moonlight.
        {$charname}: But unless the things that are done involve working out, I am not interested.
    <<endif>>
-> start singing a song
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: It's astounding...
    You: Time is fleeting...
    You: Madness... takes it's toll..
    You: But listen closely!
    {$charname}: Not for very much longer.
    You: I've got to... keep control.
    You: I remember doing the Time Warp!
    You: Drinking those moments when...
    You: The blackness would hit me!
    Together: And the void would be calling
    Together: Let's do the time warp again...
    Together: Let's do the time warp again!
    You do the Time Warp.
    Again.
    It works out surprisingly well.
You: I feel like I already know you better!
You: But now I would really like to know what you think about:
-> Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula <<if $charname != "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    {$charname}: Looks like she bites. <<if $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: We may have our big differences but she is really smart and I appreciate that. <<if $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: Nice teeth. <<if $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: I think she should work out more. Being so frail and pale is not healthy. <<if $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
-> Bobo Blocksberg <<if $charname != "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum - 1>>
    <<endif>>
    {$charname}: Should take life more seriously. <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: Weird guy. Spends all his time in a room without turning on the lämps. <<if $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: Twink. <<if $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: He just makes me want to take care of him. <<if $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
-> Mothperson <<if $charname != "Mothperson">>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    {$charname}: They have only one interest but at least they are really into it. <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: Always to much light wherever they are. <<if $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: A veritable lämp-enthusiast! <<if $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: Funny creature. <<if $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
-> Fishy McFishface <<if $charname != "Fishy McFishface">>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    {$charname}: *blushed* umm... well... <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: Blocked me on Grindr. <<if $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: Fishman. <<if $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: What a smile! <<if $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
-> Muscle Mummy <<if $charname != "Muscle Mummy">>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    {$charname}: Wouldn't mind studying her anatomy. <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: Queen! <<if $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: So sweaty. <<if $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: So dedicated! I love it! <<if $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
-> The Ghost
    {$charname}: Boo!
You: I really enjoyed our time together.
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: Bet you say that to everyone.
    You: ...
    You: Yes, yes I do.
    {$charname}: I guess that's the point of the show.
    You smile.
    You: Touché.
<<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    You: But you have to tell me.
    You: Was there a party after the elimination yesterday?
    You: And why wasn't I invited?
    {$charname}: Well...
    He's avoiding eye-contact.
    {$charname}: You weren't invited because there wasn't a party.
    {$charname}: Just me alone in this room.
    He smiles weakly.
    {$charname}: Pathetic, aren't I?
    You: I don't think so.
    {$charname}: You don't?
    He seems genuinely surprised.
    You: Next time, just tell me and then we can drink alone together.
    {$charname}: I would love that.
<<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    You: Your lämp is really pretty.
    {$charname}: And so are you.
    They blush.
    You blush.
    Both of you are blushing even harder because the other one is blushing.
    You are stuck in a blush loop.
    It's really adorable.
<<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: Well, wasn't that a pleasure?
    You: ...pleasure.
    What are you doing?
    You were just able to form proper sentences a second ago and now his hand has accidentally brushed your thigh and your brain is going haywire again.
    {$charname}: We should do that again sometimes.
    He has the nerve to wink at you and flash a smile so bright it might attract Mothperson.
    You suddenly have difficulty breathing.
    {$charname}: *laughs* Have I taken your breath away?
    You: I...
    You: I...
    You are wheezing.
    He starts to look really concerned.
    You: I have asthma...
    There is too much damn dust in this Villa.
    {$charname}: Where is your medication?
    He jumps up and runs out of the room after you manage to give him the important information.
    He's back with your inhaler in the blink of an eye.
    He pats your back while you wait for the meds to work.
    You: Thanks.
    {$charname}: No worries. Can't have you dying on me, can I?
    {$charname}: Not when I have so much I want to do to you... if you want me to.
    He wispers the last sentence in your ear and you feel another asthma attack oncoming.
<<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    {$charname}: I think I should get back to my workout soon.
    You: Oh, don't let me keep you from it!
    {$charname}: No, I really enjoyed this.
    {$charname}: I mean I would be glad to pause my workout for you anytime.
    You: Really?
    She nods.
    This feels like a really big compliment.
    You are not sure how to respond.
    While you are still thinking, she pulls you in a bonecrushing hug.
    Your bones are not breaking but even if they were...
    What a way to go.
    She releases you way to soon.
<<endif>>
===